<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  com.limen.claude-stub-heal — INSTANT effector for the recurring macOS Gatekeeper
  "ClaudeCode.app is damaged and can't be opened. You should move it to the Trash." dialog.

  ROOT — corrected 2026-08-05. This agent was built on the premise that "the updater periodically
  re-drops a malformed stub" and that reaping it converges. Both halves were false. The LIVE binary
  materializes ~/.local/share/claude/ClaudeCode.app on EVERY start (the vendor's own _jb()), and the
  bundle is Gatekeeper-invalid BY CONSTRUCTION — a bare-Mach-O signature seals no resources, so
  strict bundle-form codesign can never pass. Reaping it therefore guaranteed the next recreate AND
  destroyed the stable TCC identity sensor 0g8d exists to keep.

  It also could never win the race it was named for. `lsregister -dump` alone takes ~2.85s and this
  agent carries ThrottleInterval 10, against a three-syscall vendor write — a >=12.85s exposure
  window on every start. "Instant" was never achievable by tuning.

  So the effector now UNREGISTERS instead of removing, and the race stops being load-bearing: losing
  it means "briefly registered", not "identity destroyed". Reaching the fixed point sooner is nice;
  it is no longer the difference between working and not. Ideal form: IF-GATEKEEPER-INERT.

  Apply mode self-arms the heal, so this cures with NO ~/.limen.env change required. Idempotent +
  self-settling: unregistration re-fires WatchPaths once, finds nothing registered, exits inert, and
  quiesces. Darwin-only; the script fails OPEN off-darwin. Registered as load-bearing in
  spec/critical-launch-agents.json so the liveness organ restores it if a quiesce ever disables it.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.limen.claude-stub-heal</string>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/Users/4jp/Applications/DomusAgentHost.app/Contents/MacOS/DomusAgentHost</string>
        <string>run</string>
        <string>--</string>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/4jp/Workspace/limen/scripts/heal-claude-lsregister.sh</string>
        <string>--apply</string>
    </array>
    <key>WatchPaths</key>
    <array>
        <string>/Users/4jp/.local/share/claude</string>
    </array>
    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>HOME</key><string>/Users/4jp</string>
        <key>PATH</key><string>/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    </dict>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key><true/>
    <key>ThrottleInterval</key><integer>10</integer>
    <key>ProcessType</key><string>Background</string>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/Users/4jp/Workspace/limen/logs/claude-stub-heal.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/Users/4jp/Workspace/limen/logs/claude-stub-heal.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
